  <h2>Military-Friendly Communities in East San Antonio</h2>

  <p>East San Antonio offers established neighborhoods, excellent schools, and strong military family communities. Perfect for military families seeking stable, family-oriented areas.</p>

  <h3>Live Oak: Established Excellence</h3>
  <p>Live Oak represents the best of established military communities with top-rated schools, established neighborhoods, and strong community bonds.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Population: ~17,000</li>
    <li>Schools: North East ISD (top-rated)</li>
    <li>Neighborhoods: Established</li>
    <li>Community: Strong military culture</li>
    <li>Value: Excellent</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Spring Branch: Hill Country Proximity</h3>
  <p>North of San Antonio with Hill Country charm, newer developments, and great schools. Perfect for families wanting space with easy base access.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Character: Rural-suburban</li>
    <li>Schools: Quality education</li>
    <li>Landscape: Beautiful Hill Country</li>
    <li>New Construction: Growing</li>
    <li>Space: Larger lots</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>East San Antonio Advantages</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Established communities with stability</li>
    <li>Excellent schools and family services</li>
    <li>Strong military family networks</li>
    <li>Good home values</li>
    <li>Diverse housing options</li>
